  "about": "The app-screen rows of trillion-workshop docs/worker-retirement-port-backlog.json that had no home on any main and are not carried by trillion-apps PR #11, moved byte for byte from the tag old-trillion-before-worker-retire into trillion-apps web/ under their source paths (the two native app build scripts to scripts/). records/workshop-screen-tool-records.json is read as rows: trillion-apps main already holds it at web/records/ (changed there since, PR #8), and the moved files read that copy at the same relative path. homes_in_packages: the parts/eeaf and parts/record-log files these screens import already have a home in the Workshop (the EEAF job carried them, each named in the receipt beside it), so the screens import them from the trillion-workshop package; this lane moves none of them.",
